</div><noscript><p style="padding:2rem;background:#fef3c7;color:#111">La interfaz necesita JavaScript para consultar los datos del torneo. Activá JavaScript para continuar.</p></noscript><%@ include file="partials/header.jspf" %><main class="w-full pt-28 bg-background min-h-screen" data-arena-main=""><% if (request.getAttribute("flash") != null) { %><div class="arena-flash <%= "error".equals(request.getAttribute("flashKind")) ? "error" : "" %>" role="status"><%=com.torneo.Web.esc(String.valueOf(request.getAttribute("flash")))%></div><% } %><section class="w-full bg-primary text-on-primary px-margin py-space-xl"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><span class="text-secondary font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest">BRACKET ARENA · TEMPORADA 2026</span><h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl uppercase mt-2">CREAR NUEVO TORNEO</h1><p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-primary-fixed mt-3">Configurá la edición, aprobá 16 equipos y decidí si querés la simulación automática.</p></div></section><section class="w-full px-margin py-space-xl"><div class="arena-create-wrap bg-surface shadow-md rounded-xl p-space-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm mb-space-lg"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary">emoji_events</span><h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg">CONFIGURACIÓN OFICIAL</h2></div><form class="arena-stitch-form" id="arena-create-form" method="post"><input name="csrf" value="<%=com.torneo.Web.esc((String)request.getAttribute("csrf"))%>" type="hidden"/><input name="action" type="hidden" value="tournament.create"/><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-md"><label>Nombre oficial<input maxlength="140" name="name" placeholder="Copa Nacional 2026" required=""/></label><label>Imagen del torneo (URL, opcional)<input maxlength="1024" name="image" placeholder="https://..." type="url"/></label><label>Fecha de inicio<input name="start" required="" type="date"/></label><label>Fecha de finalización<input name="end" required="" type="date"/></label><label class="md:col-span-2">Premio en colones (CRC)<input max="999999999999.99" min="0" name="prize" required="" step="0.01" type="number" value="0"/></label></div><div class="arena-create-team-section"><h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md">EQUIPOS CLASIFICADOS (16 OBLIGATORIOS)</h3><p class="text-on-surface-variant">Seleccioná exactamente 16 equipos aprobados.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-space-sm my-space-md" id="arena-create-team-list"></div></div><label class="arena-check-option"><input name="autoSimulate" type="checkbox" value="on"/><span><strong>SIMULAR AUTOMÁTICAMENTE LOS 15 PARTIDOS</strong><small>Opcional. El torneo se resolverá al instante y los resúmenes de todos los encuentros quedarán disponibles para reproducirse o saltarse.</small></span></label><button class="arena-action" type="submit">CREAR TORNEO Y GENERAR LLAVES</button></form></div></section></main><footer class="w-full bg-surface-container-low py-space-xl mt-space-xl"><div class="w-full px-margin flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-md"><div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded bg-primary flex items-center justify-center"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[14px]">emoji_events</span></div><span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md uppercase text-on-surface">BRACKET ARENA</span></div><div class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant text-center">© 2026 Bracket Arena Technologies. Sistema Profesional de Gestión de Torneos Eliminatorios.</div><div class="flex items-center gap-space-md font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant uppercase"><a class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Reglamento</a><a class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">Soporte</a><a class="hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">API Torneo</a></div></div></footer><script>window.ARENA_BASE = '<%=request.getContextPath()%>';</script><script defer="" src="<%=request.getContextPath()%>/js/stitch-runtime.js"></script></body></html>